# Enhanced Data Table Rules & Best Practices

## 🎯 OVERVIEW
This document outlines the rules and best practices for using the enhancedDataTable component that integrates Tanstack Table with advanced features like pagination, column resizing, reordering, and Joveo design system compliance.

## 🚀 CORE FEATURES

### **1. Pagination**
- **Automatic pagination** with configurable page sizes (10, 20, 30, 40, 50)
- **Navigation controls** with first, previous, next, and last page buttons
- **Page size selector** for customizing rows per page
- **Row count display** showing current selection and total records

### **2. Column Resizing**
- **Drag handles** on the right edge of each column header
- **Minimum width enforcement** (100px) to prevent unusable columns
- **Visual feedback** with hover states and cursor changes
- **Persistent sizing** during the session

### **3. Column Reordering**
- **Drag and drop** column headers to reorder
- **Visual indicators** with grip handles and drag states
- **Keyboard support** for accessibility
- **Smooth animations** during reordering

### **4. Advanced Sorting**
- **Multi-column sorting** with visual indicators
- **Sort direction** arrows (ascending/descending)
- **Clickable headers** for easy sorting
- **Custom sort functions** support

### **5. Search & Filtering**
- **Global search** across all searchable columns
- **Column-specific filters** for targeted filtering
- **Real-time search** with debounced input
- **Highlighted results** for better UX

### **6. Column Visibility**
- **Show/hide columns** via dropdown menu
- **Persistent visibility** state
- **Selective hiding** for focused views
- **Responsive column management**

## 📋 IMPLEMENTATION PATTERNS

### **Basic Table Setup**
```typescript
import { DataTable } from "@/components/ui/data-table"
import { createColumnHelper, ColumnDef } from "@tanstack/react-table"

interface YourDataType {
  id: string
  name: string
  // ... other properties
}

export function YourTable() {
  const columnHelper = createColumnHelper<YourDataType>()
  
  const columns: ColumnDef<YourDataType, any>[] = [
    columnHelper.accessor("name", {
      header: "Name",
      cell: ({ getValue }) => <span>{getValue()}</span>,
      size: 200, // Initial column width
    }),
    // ... more columns
  ]

  return (
    <DataTable
      columns={columns}
      data={yourData}
      enableSearch={true}
      enableColumnVisibility={true}
      enableColumnReordering={true}
      enableColumnResizing={true}
      enablePagination={true}
      pageSize={20}
    />
  )
}
```

### **Advanced Column Definitions**
```typescript
// Checkbox column for row selection
columnHelper.display({
  id: "select",
  header: ({ table }) => (
    <Checkbox
      checked={table.getIsAllRowsSelected()}
      onCheckedChange={table.getToggleAllRowsSelectedHandler()}
    />
  ),
  cell: ({ row }) => (
    <Checkbox
      checked={row.getIsSelected()}
      onCheckedChange={row.getToggleSelectedHandler()}
    />
  ),
  size: 50,
  enableSorting: false,
  enableResizing: false,
}),

// Custom cell renderer with complex content
columnHelper.accessor("budgetUtilization", {
  header: "Budget Utilization%",
  cell: ({ row }) => (
    <div className="space-y-2">
      <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
        <span>${row.original.spend.toLocaleString()}</span>
        <span>{row.original.budgetUtilization.toFixed(2)}%</span>
      </div>
      <Progress value={row.original.budgetUtilization} />
    </div>
  ),
  size: 200,
}),

// Action column with buttons
columnHelper.display({
  id: "actions",
  header: "",
  cell: ({ row }) => (
    <div className="flex items-center space-x-2">
      <Button variant="ghost" size="sm">
        <EyeIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
      </Button>
      <Button variant="ghost" size="sm">
        <EditIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
      </Button>
    </div>
  ),
  size: 120,
  enableSorting: false,
})
```

### **Total Row Implementation**
```typescript
// Define total row data
const totalRowData: Partial<YourDataType> = {
